WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Confirm the store identity
Confirm the tenant identity or store code before reviewing records.
Branches belong to their store; they are not separate vendor workspaces.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Check configuration boundaries
Read editable fields and platform-controlled values separately. A
displayed setting does not by itself prove a related workflow is
enabled.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Separate method label and credentials
Provider, customer label and display order are separate fields.
Credentials are write-only and replaceable; this blank form was not
saved.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Inspect delivery configuration or parcels
Match the order, carrier, tracking reference and recorded events. A
missing carrier or arrival time needs follow-up; it is not delivery
confirmation.

